        "original_id": "79ed4c8c-368d-5995-9649-62db0dfe9f4a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lene Bausager, Sean Biggerstaff, Emilia Fox, Amanda Burton\n- Works: Cashback, Silent Witness\n- Roles: Producer, Actor, Dr. Nikki Alexander\n\nFacts:\n- Emilia Fox was born as Emilia Rose Elizabeth Fox on 31 July 1974, and she is an English actress.\n- Lene Bausager produced both versions of Cashback.\n- Sean Biggerstaff and Emilia Fox starred in Cashback.\n- In 2004, Emilia Fox joined the cast of the BBC crime drama Silent Witness after Amanda Burton departed.\n- Emilia Fox is known for playing Dr. Nikki Alexander on Silent Witness.",
